  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed variation of Condition 8 would permit occupation by an excessive number of occupiers resulting in a significant intensification of the approved use. For this reason, the proposal would constitute an over-intensive form of development that would be harmful to the living conditions of future occupiers and neighbouring residents, erode the established residential character of the area, and result in additional pressure on the local highway network and parking provision. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policies GR1, GR2, HO7, M1 and M2 of the adopted Harrow Local Plan 2021-2041, Policies D3, D6 and T6 of the London Plan (2021), the objectives of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024) and Harrow SPD New developments and conversions strategy – taking waste into account (Oct 2023).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;"
